    productionScenario: "A cluster has 3 nodegroups: standard (t3.medium, on-demand, critical services), batch (c5.2xlarge, Spot, CI/CD jobs), gpu (g4dn.xlarge, Spot, ML inference). Each has different taints and resource configurations. Cluster autoscaler scales each independently based on pending pod resource requests.",
