        practical: ["Design a nodegroup strategy for a cluster running critical web services + batch ML training", "How do you handle Spot instance interruptions gracefully?"],
          scenario: ["A nodegroup shows 0 nodes but there are pending pods. Why? (Cluster autoscaler issue, instance limits, AZ capacity)", "GPU pods stuck in Pending despite GPU nodegroup existing. What do you check?"],
