      midSize: "docs/ folder in repo, runbooks for common incidents, Swagger API.",
        enterprise: "Internal wiki, Backstage service catalog, automated doc generation, stale doc alerts.",
          faang: "Comprehensive internal documentation culture: docs-as-code, embedded in PR process, automated quality checks, quarterly doc audits."
