        output: "Created stream: ORDERS\n\n+---------------------+-------------------+------------------+\n|WINDOWSTART          |USER_ID            |TOTAL_SPENT       |\n+---------------------+-------------------+------------------+\n|2025-05-30 14:00:00  |42                 |450.75            |\n|2025-05-30 14:00:00  |15                 |299.50            |\n|2025-05-30 15:00:00  |42                 |150.00            |",
          explanation: "KSQL: SQL interface for Kafka Streams. Create STREAM from topic (orders). Query computes 1-hour tumbling window SUM(amount) per user, emitting changes in real-time.",
